n class=\"br-dawn br-dawn--rest\"><span class=\"br-dawn__rays\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"br-rest\"><div class=\"br-rest__logo\"><span class=\"br-rest__glow\"></span><img src=\"http://localhost:4772/assets/img/bread/logo-b-512.webp\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\"></div>\n        <h1>«خبز الحياة» قرّب 🤍</h1><p>البرنامج بيبدأ الجمعة ٢٧ نوفمبر، ٣٠ يوم، كل يوم كلمة جديدة ليك إنت.</p></div><svg class=\"br-dawn__hills\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 96\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M0,40 C120,10 220,22 300,34 C380,8 460,12 540,32 C640,6 760,10 1000,36 V96 H0 Z\" fill=\"#5d5a73\" opacity=\".55\"></path>\n  <path class=\"h2\" d=\"M0,70 C160,44 300,58 420,68 C560,50 720,46 1000,62 V96 H0 Z\"></path>\n  <path class=\"h3\" d=\"M0,86 C200,74 800,74 1000,86 V96 H0 Z\"></path></svg></section>\n    <div class=\"br-sheet-page br-sheet-page--rest\">\n      <section class=\"widget br-card\"><div class=\"br-remind\"><span class=\"br-remind__ic\"><svg class=\"icon icon--line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"duo\" d=\"M6 16.5V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5.5l1.5 2h-15Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 16.5V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5.5l1.5 2h-15ZM10 20.5a2 2 0 0 0 4 0M12 8.5V11l1.6 1.2\"></path></svg></span><div><b>فكّرني لما يبدأ</b><small>إشعار واحد الصبح بكلمة النهارده أول ما البرنامج الجديد يبدأ.</small></div><button class=\"br-switch\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"فكّرني\" data-act=\"remind\"></button></div></section>\n      <a class=\"btn btn--block\" href=\"http://localhost:4772/\"><svg class=\"icon icon--line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"duo\" d=\"M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-4v-6h-5v6h-4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 19Z\"></path><path d=\"M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-4v-6h-5v6h-4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 19Z\"></path></svg>ارجع للموقع</a>\n    </div><footer class=\"br-sig\"><img src=\"http://localhost:4772/assets/img/bread/logo-b-512.webp\" width=\"92\" height=\"92\" alt=\"خبزنا اليومي\"><p><b>إعداد وإشراف أسرة البابا أثناسيوس الرسولي للشباب</b><br>كنيسة أبي سيفين بسفاجا</p></footer></main><nav class=\"tabbar\" aria-label=\"أقسام خبزنا اليومي\"><span class=\"tabbar__lens\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; transform: translate(-1px, -1px); opacity: 1;\"></span><div class=\"tabbar__slots\">\n    <a class=\"tabbar__tab\" href=\"?\" data-tab=\"today\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"icon icon--line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"duo\" d=\"M12 7.6C10 6.2 6.9 5.8 4 6.4v11.2c2.9-.6 6-.2 8 1.2 2-1.4 5.1-1.8 8-1.2V6.4c-2.9-.6-6-.2-8 1.2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 7.6C10 6.2 6.9 5.8 4 6.4v11.2c2.9-.6 6-.2 8 1.2 2-1.4 5.1-1.8 8-1.2V6.4c-2.9-.6-6-.2-8 1.2Zm0 0v11.2\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 3.6a3 3 0 0 1 5 0M12 1.6v.9M8.2 2.6l.5.6M15.8 2.6l-.5.6\"></path></svg><span class=\"tabbar__word\">النهارده</span></a><a class=\"tabbar__tab\" href=\"?s=reminders\" data-tab=\"reminders\"><svg class=\"icon icon--line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"duo\" d=\"M6 16.5V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5.5l1.5 2h-15Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 16.5V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5.5l1.5 2h-15ZM10 20.5a2 2 0 0 0 4 0M12 8.5V11l1.6 1.2\"></path></svg><span class=\"tabbar__word\">إعداداتي</span></a><a class=\"tabbar__tab\" href=\"http://localhost:4772/\" data-tab=\"site\"><svg class=\"icon icon--line\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"duo\" d=\"M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-4v-6h-5v6h-4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 19Z\"></path><path d=\"M4 10.5 12 4l8 6.5V19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-4v-6h-5v6h-4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 19Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"tabbar__word\">الموقع</span></a>\n  </div><a class=\"acct-badge tabbar__tab tabbar__fixed\" href=\"http://localhost:4772/account/\" data-acct=\"\" data-tab=\"account\"><span class=\"acct-badge__face\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM4 21c1-4.4 4-6 8-6s7 1.6 8 6\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"tabbar__word\">حسابي</span></a></nav><p class=\"br-toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></p>"
